.TH "analeptique-by-acetate" "6" "2026-11-13" "Analeptique User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
analeptique-by-acetate - 4k intro by Acetate
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
analeptique-by-acetate
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Analeptique is a 4k intro written in C with SDL by Acetate, released in
2004 for the #demoscene 4k source compo, where it ranked 2nd ex aequo
with 39 points.
.PP
All the effects are computed in software and drawn into a 256x256
window: noise, rotating squares, wobbling raster bars, zooming bitmap
texts and greetings.
The scenes loop until the intro is stopped.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]Any key\f[R]
Quits the intro.
Closing the window also quits it.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH BUGS
.PP
